message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "A Visual Trace Map of Edinburgh Place Names in Literature"
abstract: >-
  An interactive visualisation system exploring literary place names in
  Edinburgh through two research directions — author spatial "fingerprints"
  and narrative co-occurrence topology — built on the LitLong Edinburgh
  database as an MSc dissertation at the University of Edinburgh, School of
  Informatics.
authors:
